A `conforms` turns the scan on: every build measures `example` against the profile and publishes the score.

  1) standard  Standard System Security Profile for Fedora
  2) ospp  Protection Profile for General Purpose Operating Systems
Which profile? [1-2, 0 for none]: 1

Import the components claiming these rules? (Yes/No)
Yes


example/
├── components/
│   ├── sshd/
│   │   └── + manifest.kdl
│   └── ~ components.lock.kdl  sshd recorded
└── ~ example.image.kdl  measured against `standard`, and sshd added to components
